WEBVTT

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:30.330
with a view across generations,
instead of quarter-to-quarter,

00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:32.063
to benefit more people

00:02:32.063 --> 00:02:34.530
and to anchor wealth in communities

00:02:34.563 --> 00:02:37.063
that might not otherwise
attract investment,

00:02:37.097 --> 00:02:39.897
while still being
competitive and innovative.

00:02:40.397 --> 00:02:42.130
Sounds pretty good, right?

00:02:42.863 --> 00:02:46.230
I guess that's why,
at the end of a class the other day,

00:02:46.263 --> 00:02:50.963
a student, all red and jazzed up,
basically shouted at me.

00:02:50.963 --> 00:02:53.263
"I've always been a straight A student,

00:02:53.263 --> 00:02:55.297
done all the work, read all the books,

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:58.163
and now you're telling me
that all my life,

00:02:58.197 --> 00:03:02.130
I've missed hearing about a movement
with this magnitude?"